1
00:00:00,612 --> 00:00:02,252
(Amy:)-What?
-Poor Bernadette.

2
00:00:02,414 --> 00:00:05,764
(Sheldon:)I hate to pile on the bad news,
but I just got a raise.

3
00:00:14,593 --> 00:00:17,163
(Howard:)My God, Bernie, what happened?

4
00:00:17,329 --> 00:00:19,829
(Bernadette:)Well, let's just say the next time
you move a dozen vials

5
00:00:19,998 --> 00:00:23,038
(Bernadette:)of raccoon virus to the fridge,
make two trips.

6
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:26,340
(Howard:)You're sure you're okay?

7
00:00:26,505 --> 00:00:28,675
(Bernadette:)Yeah, it's just a precaution.
If there was a problem,

8
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,220
(Bernadette:)I'd be throwing up
out of my eyeballs by now.

9
00:00:33,278 --> 00:00:35,778
(Bernadette:)-Sorry I messed up our date.
-No, don't worry about it.

10
00:00:35,947 --> 00:00:37,617
(Howard:)I brought the date here.

11
00:00:37,783 --> 00:00:39,383
(Howard:)Guys, come on in.

12
00:00:40,519 --> 00:00:41,519
(Bernadette:)What's all this?

13
00:00:41,687 --> 00:00:45,137
(Howard:)Well, tonight is the anniversary
of our first date,

14
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:48,860
(Howard:)and I wanted to celebrate it
by writing a song for you.

15
00:00:49,027 --> 00:00:50,167
(Bernadette:)Howie.

16
00:00:50,329 --> 00:00:52,069
Sheldon, get over hers!

17
00:00:52,998 --> 00:00:54,568
(Sheldon:)She might be contagious.

18
00:00:56,068 --> 00:00:58,178
(Sheldon:)Don't you think I'm having
a rough enough day?

19
00:00:58,804 --> 00:01:08,024
Sheldon!

